@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.18
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:君が他人を守る？<br>冗談だろう？|#0205Trial04_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.18
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:これまで自分を<br>世間にアピールすることに<br>執心してきた君が？|#0205Trial04_Hiro002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.16
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:いったい君は<br>これまでその承認欲求で<br>何人のライバルを<br>蹴落としてきたのかな。|#0205Trial04_Hiro003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR1,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"け、<link=\"Objection_02_05_04_01\">蹴落として</link>なんて<br>いない！|#0205Trial04_Leia001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.16
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:本当だろうか？<br>君は芸能人だし、<br>その立ち振る舞いを見ても<br>裕福な家で育ったのが<br>見てとれる……。|#0205Trial04_Hiro004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.20
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:たとえ自身が<br>手を下していなかったとしても、<br>君に潰された人間は<br>多いんじゃないかな。|#0205Trial04_Hiro005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だ、だからって、<br>それとこれとは別問題だ！|#0205Trial04_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR5,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"だいたい……<br>それぐらいで諦めるなら、<br>その人物は<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_04_02\">それまでだった</link>と<br>いうことでもある……！|#0205Trial04_Leia003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR9,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"私は<link=\"Objection_02_05_04_03\">正々堂々</link>と努力して、<br>舞台に立っていた！|#0205Trial04_Leia004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR10,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:君が言っていることは<br>根も葉もない誹謗中傷だ！|#0205Trial04_Leia005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR3,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんなことより……<br>建設的なことを<br>話し合うべきじゃないかな！|#0205Trial04_Leia006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,Arms,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Fearful_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:みんなでこれから<br>どうしたらいいのか……<br>この牢屋敷をどうやって<br>脱出するのか……！|#0205Trial04_Leia007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"希望はある！<br>みんな私に<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_04_04\">ついてきてくれ</link>たまえ！|#0205Trial04_Leia008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


